Exceptions

The MIT license above covers the source code and the documentation. It
does not cover the following, which ship in this repository and in the
built application but are not the project's to license:

* The mascot artwork: public/joecamel.png and every file under
  src-tauri/icons/. This is the "Joe Camel" advertising character, a
  trademark and copyrighted artwork of R.J. Reynolds Tobacco Company,
  used here as parody. No rights in it are granted; do not reuse it
  outside this project.

* The wordmark lettering: public/fonts/IqbalCamel-Regular.ttf, and the
  outlines baked into .github/banner.svg. This is a fan-made typeface
  imitating the lettering of the Camel cigarette trademark. The
  typeface's own license is unknown, and the lettering it imitates
  belongs to its trademark owner. No rights in either are granted.

* The other typefaces under public/fonts/ are redistributed under the
  SIL Open Font License 1.1, copyright their respective authors; see
  public/fonts/OFL.txt.

Replicator is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or connected to R.J.
Reynolds Tobacco Company, nor to Fenris Creations, whose EVE Online
trademarks the application refers to.
